#: ../../tools/openalex_tools.rst:168 31d98f14b596449fa2e0492cff4b92ed
msgid ""
"**Description**: Search for academic literature using OpenAlex. Supports "
"optional full-text-index filtering (has\\_fulltext + fulltext.search) "
"when you need body-only term discovery, but note: OpenAlex full-text "
"indexing is incomplete, and a work can be open-access elsewhere (e.g., "
"PMC) while still having has\\_fulltext=false in OpenAlex. Returns paper "
"metadata and (when available) OA links/content URLs."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/openalex_tools.rst:172 53d7a9c3c0204e55a7e23c5564bfd1ea
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"``search_keywords`` (string) (optional) Keywords to search for in paper "
"titles/abstracts/etc. For full-text-index-only matching, also use "
"require\\_has\\_fulltext/fulltext\\_terms."
msgstr "``search_keywords``（字符串）（必填）用于在论文标题、摘要和内容中搜索的关键词。请使用相关的科学术语或短语。"

#: ../../tools/openalex_tools.rst:175 9716c8a3395f44c7a3eb500dcd30ea84
msgid ""
"``query`` (string) (optional) Alias for \\`search\\_keywords\\` "
"(recommended when you standardize on \\`query\\` across multiple paper-"
"search tools)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/openalex_tools.rst:178 fc86e4cd863e407c923eca2116fb91a8
msgid ""
"``max_results`` (integer) (optional) Maximum number of papers to retrieve"
" (default: 10, maximum: 200)."
msgstr "``max_results``（整数）（可选）要检索的论文最大数量（默认值：10，最大值：200）。"

#: ../../tools/openalex_tools.rst:181 232bfccd28d143b4bf70a0d15a225f02
msgid ""
"``limit`` (integer) (optional) Alias for \\`max\\_results\\` (OpenAlex "
"max 200)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/openalex_tools.rst:184 838869172eaf46b4bb98a3d0abcc4f9d
msgid ""
"``year_from`` (integer) (optional) Start year for publication date filter"
" (e.g., 2020). Optional parameter to limit search to papers published "
"from this year onwards."
msgstr "``year_from``（整数）（可选）用于筛选出版日期的起始年份（例如：2020）。这是一个可选参数，用于将搜索范围限制为从该年份起发布的论文。"

#: ../../tools/openalex_tools.rst:187 266000132e2b44b5bdf5cc23bd9d3c2c
msgid ""
"``year_to`` (integer) (optional) End year for publication date filter "
"(e.g., 2023). Optional parameter to limit search to papers published up "
"to this year."
msgstr "``year_to``（整数）（可选）用于筛选出版日期的结束年份（例如：2023）。可选参数，用于将搜索范围限制为截至该年份发表的论文。"

#: ../../tools/openalex_tools.rst:190 03a5ef381d1a442a8dc8234f5006e560
msgid ""
"``open_access`` (boolean) (optional) Filter for open access papers only. "
"Set to true for open access papers, false for non-open access, or omit "
"for all papers."
msgstr ""
"``open_access``（布尔值）（可选）仅筛选开放获取的论文。设置为 true 表示仅开放获取的论文，设置为 false "
"表示非开放获取的论文，或省略以包含所有论文。"

#: ../../tools/openalex_tools.rst:193 81179291a6034dc4b14a1233f749c6fb
msgid ""
"``require_has_fulltext`` (boolean) (optional) If true, filters to works "
"where OpenAlex indicates a full-text index is available "
"(has\\_fulltext:true)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/openalex_tools.rst:196 8cad874b81904cb680f67c5d76a1ab64
msgid ""
"``fulltext_terms`` (array) (optional) Optional list of terms that must "
"occur in OpenAlex full-text index (adds fulltext.search:<term> filters "
"and implicitly enables require\\_has\\_fulltext)."
msgstr ""

