#: ../../tools/openalex_tools.rst:302 f71b9c49fa764cfc9029eb9ec09bd7f3
msgid ""
"**Description**: Search OpenAlex works (papers) via the /works endpoint. "
"Supports both general search and optional full-text-index filtering: set "
"require\\_has\\_fulltext=true and/or pass fulltext\\_terms to add "
"OpenAlex filters (has\\_fulltext:true and fulltext.search:<term>). "
"Important: has\\_fulltext/fulltext.search only match works where OpenAlex"
" has indexed full text; this can miss papers whose full text is available"
" elsewhere (e.g., PMC) but not indexed by OpenAlex. Use this to discover "
"Work IDs (W...) and DOIs, then follow up with "
"openalex\\_get\\_work/openalex\\_get\\_work\\_by\\_doi to retrieve OA "
"links and (sometimes) content\\_urls."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/openalex_tools.rst:306 f572ea9cf07e4ce3b0c8ee1319f49de7
msgid ""
"``search`` (string) (optional) Search query for works. Use filter + "
"fulltext\\_terms/require\\_has\\_fulltext when you need full-text-index-"
"only matching."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/openalex_tools.rst:309 7f6765ae19914b8895cde3667954754c
msgid ""
"``query`` (string) (optional) Alias for \\`search\\` (recommended when "
"you standardize on \\`query\\` across multiple paper-search tools)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/openalex_tools.rst:312 0655a80270b942b2835f1f7affda6c14
msgid ""
