msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/openalex_tools.rst:315 2fb5b2ba40044617aa360c94f572258f
msgid ""
"``require_has_fulltext`` (boolean) (optional) If true, appends OpenAlex "
"filter has\\_fulltext:true (keeps only works with full-text index "
"available)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/openalex_tools.rst:318 bb292c34b2bf468785c9d1e8fa9d076f
msgid ""
"``fulltext_terms`` (array) (optional) Optional list of terms to match in "
